# What must never reach a build.
#
# reference/ holds the screen recordings this project was built from. They
# contain the owner's real contacts, phone numbers and a personal chat. The
# Dockerfile does not copy them, but everything here is still handed to the
# build daemon and can end up in a cached layer or a pushed image, so they are
# excluded outright rather than merely not copied.
reference/
docs/
.superpowers/

# Secrets.
cf/.dev.vars
.env
.env.*

# Rebuilt inside the image, or irrelevant to it.
node_modules/
*/node_modules/
out/
web/
.next/
.wrangler/
.git/
.github/
test/
recipes/
*.mp4
*.png
!kit/**/*.png
